{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3501ae3ca22d60a3","name":"Incinerator Rifle","source":{"id":"source:reference-3501ae3ca22d60a3","title":"Incinerator Rifle","revision":19488,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:03:54Z","sha256":"258c7b1545571952681e421258edb75a72b8e3bb9ca9a79d80e6efb86ee8c23d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19488","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Incinerator%20Rifle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3501ae3ca22d60a3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Often used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothan","referenceId":"reference:d0c2f0ae1f6a1f5d"}," spies to hide the evidence of their misdeeds, the Incinerator Rifle works on the same basic principles as the Disruptor Weapons popularized by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Tenloss Syndicate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Tenloss_Syndicate","referenceId":"reference:64be5d4d50be1387"},". Though the Incinerator Rifle is technically no more powerful than a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"},", an Incinerator Rifle dissolves many of the molecular bonds in any target it strikes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["By the time a target is killed or destroyed, the Incinerator Rifle has broken molecular bonds to the point where the target loses all cohesion. As a result, the wielder of an Incinerator Rifle can kill an enemy and dispose of the body all at the same time. A creature or character killed by an Incinerator Rifle (or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", or object destroyed by one) is automatically disintegrated, leaving no trace behind.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Incinerator Rifle requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 20 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
